<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>CSS Selectors Activity</title>
    <style>
        /* 1. Universal Selector — applies to EVERYTHING */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        /* 2. Element Selector — targets all <h1> and <p> elements */
        h1 {
            color: #2c3e50;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #ecf0f1;
        }

        p {
            color: #34495e;
            font-size: 17px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 15px 20px;
        }

        /* 3. ID Selector — targets ONE specific element with id="highlight" */
        #highlight {
            background-color: #fef9c3;
            border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b;
            padding: 12px;
            margin: 10px 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>Welcome to My CSS Selectors Page</h1>

    <p>This paragraph is styled using the <strong>Element Selector</strong> — all &lt;p&gt; tags share this look.</p>

    <p id="highlight">This paragraph is styled using the <strong>ID Selector</strong> — unique style only for this element.</p>

    <p>Notice consistent spacing and font everywhere? That's the <strong>Universal Selector (*)</strong> at work!</p>

</body>
</html>
